# The build needs go.mod, go.sum, cmd/ and internal/ -- nothing else. Without
# this file `COPY . .` hands the daemon ~190MB, almost all of it the MMDB in
# data/ and the cross-compiled binaries in bin/, both of which are gitignored
# and neither of which any image uses.
.git
.github
data
bin
output
prefixes.txt
*.mmdb
*.key

# Docs and plans: not inputs to any build.
*.md
!deploy/openwrt/README.md
